 main city on the island of Tenerife, with nearly half of the island's population living in or around it.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/At_Palmetum_de_Santa_Cruz_de_Tenerife_2022_028.jpg/330px-At_Palmetum_de_Santa_Cruz_de_Tenerife_2022_028.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Cruz_de_Tenerife"},"twins":["Q8678","Q975","Q15682","Q495380","Q1533","Q33959","Q270302","Q1555","Q34820","Q8826"],"climate":{"temp":[18.4,18.1,18.4,19.2,20.2,21.7,22.7,23.6,23.9,23.3,21.3,19.7],"rain":[25,32,22,15,7,3,2,5,10,25,35,39],"cloud":[59,60,61,60,60,55,58,53,48,55,63,60]},"land":true}